    Bug 1930947 - Account Hub email auto config form should have continue enabled if valid. r=aleca

    **How to Test**
    - Use example.com in the first form
    - The continue button should be disabled on the incoming form
    - Go back to the initial form
    - The continue button should still be enabled

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D230340

